{"seq":3,"slug":"per-tenant-key-and-audit","title":"Per-tenant 密钥隔离与审计日志 schema","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/per-tenant-key-and-audit","wordCount":1129,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"per-tenant-密钥隔离与审计日志-schema\">Per-tenant 密钥隔离与审计日志 schema</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>multi-tenant 不只是工作空间隔离，还包括安全凭证隔离与审计可追溯。OpenClaw 把这两个能力做成系统化机制：<strong>per-tenant secret store</strong> 让每个 persona 持有独立 API key / token / OAuth credential，跨 persona 读取被 OS 与应用层双重拒绝；<strong>统一 audit log</strong> 记录所有跨 persona 访问尝试、secret 取用、合规相关动作，schema 设计支持 SOC2 evidence 提取、GDPR right-to-be-forgotten 删除、HIPAA partition。本篇按&quot;secret store 实现&quot;、&quot;horizontal access 拒绝路径&quot;、&quot;audit log schema 与 cause chain&quot;、&quot;企业合规接入&quot;四块讲。前置阅读：<a href=\"dm-pairing-and-isolation\"><code>./2_dm-pairing-and-isolation.md</code></a> 的 isolated workspace 部分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  P1[persona dev_oss] --&gt; SS1[secret store /personas/dev_oss/secrets/]&#10;  P2[persona dev_bytedance] --&gt; SS2[secret store /personas/dev_bytedance/secrets/]&#10;  P1 -. ❌ EACCES .-&gt; SS2&#10;  P2 -. ❌ EACCES .-&gt; SS1&#10;  P1 --&gt; AL[shared audit log]&#10;  P2 --&gt; AL\">flowchart LR\n  P1[persona dev_oss] --&gt; SS1[secret store /personas/dev_oss/secrets/]\n  P2[persona dev_bytedance] --&gt; SS2[secret store /personas/dev_bytedance/secrets/]\n  P1 -. ❌ EACCES .-&gt; SS2\n  P2 -. ❌ EACCES .-&gt; SS1\n  P1 --&gt; AL[shared audit log]\n  P2 --&gt; AL</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全维度</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Secret 存储</td>\n<td>per-persona 目录 / keychain entry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨 persona 读取</td>\n<td>OS 沙盒 + 应用层 ACL 双拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计</td>\n<td>统一 audit log + per-persona view</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规导出</td>\n<td>SOC2 / GDPR / HIPAA 三种 export profile</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"per-persona-secret-store\">per-persona secret store</h2><p>每 persona 在自己的隔离工作空间下有 <code>secrets/</code> 子目录。存储后端按 OS 适配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OS</th>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th>路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>Keychain</td>\n<td><code>com.openclaw.&lt;persona&gt;.&lt;key&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>libsecret / file w/ 0600</td>\n<td><code>~/.learnwy/openclaw/personas/&lt;persona&gt;/secrets/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>DPAPI</td>\n<td>per-persona credential store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>1Password CLI（可选）</td>\n<td>vault per-persona</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>写入 secret 通过 <code>openclaw secret</code> 命令，never via plain config file edit：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw secret set --persona dev_oss \\&#10;  --key github_token --value &quot;ghp_xxx&quot;&#10;&#10;openclaw secret get --persona dev_oss --key github_token&#10;openclaw secret list --persona dev_oss&#10;openclaw secret rotate --persona dev_oss --key github_token\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev_oss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> github_token</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --value</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ghp_xxx\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev_oss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> github_token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev_oss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rotate</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev_oss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> github_token</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rotate</code> 是关键操作——它生成新 secret、更新外部服务、保留旧 secret 在 grace period 内可读，然后切换。这套流程让 secret 轮换不停服。</p>\n<h2 id=\"horizontal-access-拒绝路径\">horizontal access 拒绝路径</h2><p>跨 persona 读 secret 应当被双重拒绝——OS 层与应用层各拦一道：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant P1 as persona dev_oss process&#10;  participant OS as OS sandbox&#10;  participant OC as OpenClaw secret API&#10;  participant SS2 as dev_bytedance secret store&#10;  P1-&gt;&gt;OS: open(/personas/dev_bytedance/secrets/...)&#10;  OS--&gt;&gt;P1: EACCES&#10;  Note over P1: 即使绕过 OS root&#10;  P1-&gt;&gt;OC: secret get --persona dev_bytedance&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: check active persona context&#10;  OC--&gt;&gt;P1: 403 cross-persona denied&#10;  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: emit audit_event cross_persona_attempt\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant P1 as persona dev_oss process\n  participant OS as OS sandbox\n  participant OC as OpenClaw secret API\n  participant SS2 as dev_bytedance secret store\n  P1-&gt;&gt;OS: open(/personas/dev_bytedance/secrets/...)\n  OS--&gt;&gt;P1: EACCES\n  Note over P1: 即使绕过 OS root\n  P1-&gt;&gt;OC: secret get --persona dev_bytedance\n  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: check active persona context\n  OC--&gt;&gt;P1: 403 cross-persona denied\n  OC-&gt;&gt;OC: emit audit_event cross_persona_attempt</pre><p>应用层检查的逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def secret_get(req_persona, key, *, ctx):&#10;    if ctx.active_persona != req_persona:&#10;        audit.emit(&#10;            event_type=&quot;cross_persona_attempt&quot;,&#10;            actor=ctx.active_persona,&#10;            target=req_persona,&#10;            key=key,&#10;            outcome=&quot;denied&quot;,&#10;        )&#10;        raise CrossPersonaAccessDenied&#10;    return store.read(req_persona, key)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> secret_get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req_persona, key, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ctx):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.active_persona </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req_persona:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        audit.emit(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cross_persona_attempt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            actor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.active_persona,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">req_persona,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"denied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CrossPersonaAccessDenied</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store.read(req_persona, key)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>任何 cross_persona_attempt 都被记录——即便最终允许（admin override），痕迹保留。这是&quot;零信任 + 全审计&quot;在 OpenClaw 的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"audit-log-schema\">audit log schema</h2><p>audit log 是 multi-tenant 系统的核心可观测面。OpenClaw 统一 schema：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;audit_id&quot;: &quot;aud_8a3c91&quot;,&#10;  &quot;event_type&quot;: &quot;secret_access&quot;,&#10;  &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;dev_oss&quot;,&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;lark_oc_abc&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target_peer&quot;: &quot;ou_alice_xxx&quot;,&#10;  &quot;actor&quot;: &quot;ou_user_self&quot;,&#10;  &quot;action&quot;: &quot;secret_get&quot;,&#10;  &quot;action_args&quot;: { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;github_token&quot; },&#10;  &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;success&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ts&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T03:21:09.482Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;cause_chain&quot;: [&quot;user_msg evt_in_abc&quot;, &quot;plugin transform_in&quot;, &quot;plugin call_external_api&quot;, &quot;secret_get github_token&quot;],&#10;  &quot;trace_id&quot;: &quot;trc_4f2e&quot;,&#10;  &quot;compliance_tags&quot;: [&quot;soc2_cc6&quot;, &quot;internal&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"audit_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aud_8a3c91\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"secret_access\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dev_oss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark_oc_abc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target_peer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ou_alice_xxx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"actor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ou_user_self\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"secret_get\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action_args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"github_token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"success\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T03:21:09.482Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cause_chain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_msg evt_in_abc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plugin transform_in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plugin call_external_api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"secret_get github_token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trace_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trc_4f2e\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compliance_tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"soc2_cc6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>event_type</td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>secret_access / cross_persona_attempt / data_export / persona_switch / fallback_routing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persona</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>主语 persona</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>channel</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>触发动作的频道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>target_peer</td>\n<td>string?</td>\n<td>涉及对端时填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>actor</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>物理用户 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>action</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>具体动作名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>outcome</td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>success / denied / error</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cause_chain</td>\n<td>array</td>\n<td>因果链，从最远 cause 到本动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compliance_tags</td>\n<td>array</td>\n<td>SOC2 / GDPR / HIPAA 关联控制点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>cause_chain</code> 是 OpenClaw audit 的独到设计——单条 audit 记录不只说&quot;发生了什么&quot;，还说&quot;为什么发生&quot;。这让审计员能从一条可疑动作上溯追因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规接入-soc2-gdpr-hipaa\">合规接入：SOC2 / GDPR / HIPAA</h2><p>OpenClaw 的 <code>compliance</code> 子系统针对三种主流合规体系各做了 export profile：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  AL[audit_log] --&gt; CE[compliance engine]&#10;  CE --&gt; S[SOC2 evidence export]&#10;  CE --&gt; G[GDPR right-to-be-forgotten]&#10;  CE --&gt; H[HIPAA partition export]\">flowchart TD\n  AL[audit_log] --&gt; CE[compliance engine]\n  CE --&gt; S[SOC2 evidence export]\n  CE --&gt; G[GDPR right-to-be-forgotten]\n  CE --&gt; H[HIPAA partition export]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合规框架</th>\n<th>OpenClaw 功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SOC2 CC6</td>\n<td>secret_access / cross_persona_attempt 自动按 control 编号聚合，季度生成 evidence package</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GDPR Art.17</td>\n<td>按 actor / target_peer ID 检索全部相关 audit + 业务数据，导出后批量删除并写 deletion certificate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HIPAA partition</td>\n<td>把标 PHI 的 persona 工作空间放到独立加密分区，audit 严格隔离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GDPR 删除流程示例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant A as admin&#10;  participant CE as compliance engine&#10;  participant AL as audit_log&#10;  participant FS as fs / db&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;CE: right_to_be_forgotten --subject ou_alice&#10;  CE-&gt;&gt;AL: collect all rows where actor or target = ou_alice&#10;  CE-&gt;&gt;FS: collect business data references&#10;  CE-&gt;&gt;A: dry run report (rows / files)&#10;  A--&gt;&gt;CE: confirm&#10;  CE-&gt;&gt;FS: delete&#10;  CE-&gt;&gt;AL: write deletion_certificate&#10;  CE--&gt;&gt;A: certificate signed by OC key\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant A as admin\n  participant CE as compliance engine\n  participant AL as audit_log\n  participant FS as fs / db\n  A-&gt;&gt;CE: right_to_be_forgotten --subject ou_alice\n  CE-&gt;&gt;AL: collect all rows where actor or target = ou_alice\n  CE-&gt;&gt;FS: collect business data references\n  CE-&gt;&gt;A: dry run report (rows / files)\n  A--&gt;&gt;CE: confirm\n  CE-&gt;&gt;FS: delete\n  CE-&gt;&gt;AL: write deletion_certificate\n  CE--&gt;&gt;A: certificate signed by OC key</pre><p>deletion_certificate 是带 HMAC 签名的证书，记录&quot;删除了什么、何时、谁触发&quot;，自身不可删（写一次 audit log，附在 cold storage）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-tier-1-工具栈对照\">与 Tier 1 工具栈对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Claude Code</th>\n<th>OpenClaw multi-tenant</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Secret 存储</td>\n<td>settings.json 明文或 env</td>\n<td>per-persona Keychain / DPAPI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离粒度</td>\n<td>无 persona 概念</td>\n<td>per-persona OS sandbox</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计</td>\n<td>hook stdout + 用户自维护</td>\n<td>统一 audit_log + cause_chain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规接入</td>\n<td>无原生支持</td>\n<td>SOC2 / GDPR / HIPAA profile</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tier 1 不是不能做合规，而是依赖用户自建脚本/外部 SIEM 兜底。OpenClaw 把这套机制内置化，省掉每个用户重新发明的工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>secret 写入 settings/config 文件</strong>：永远走 <code>openclaw secret set</code>，不要让 secret 出现在任何明文 yaml/json。配合 git pre-commit hook 防止误提交。</li>\n<li><strong>rotate 没设 grace period</strong>：旧 secret 立即作废 + 新 secret 还没通知到外部服务 = 一段空窗期 service down。grace 时间应根据服务通知延迟设置（典型 24h）。</li>\n<li><strong>audit log cause_chain 缺失</strong>：某些 fast-path 代码绕过 emit。code review 必须检查&quot;任何 secret_access / cross_persona / data_export&quot;路径都 emit。</li>\n<li><strong>deletion_certificate 未保留</strong>：误以为&quot;删除就完全消失&quot;。GDPR 也要求保留删除证明，certificate 必须留。</li>\n<li><strong>compliance_tags 写错对应 control 编号</strong>：SOC2 control 编号变动时需要全表更新映射。compliance engine 启动期校验 tag 词表。</li>\n<li><strong>OPS 用 root 直读 fs</strong>：绕过沙盒。生产环境应禁止任何人有 sudo 进入 persona 目录，或所有 sudo 操作必须自动写 audit。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>per-tenant secret store + horizontal access 双重拒绝 + 统一 audit log w/ cause chain + 三种合规 export profile——这四件套让 OpenClaw 把&quot;个人版 multi-tenant&quot;做出企业级合规可证可审的水准。secret 隔离不依赖应用层善意，OS-level sandbox 是底线；audit log 的 cause_chain 让事后追责能从一条可疑动作上溯到最初触发；compliance engine 的三种 profile 让 SOC2 / GDPR / HIPAA 不必每次 hand-roll。下一篇看并发多租户的资源编排——多 persona 同时运行时如何调度、限流、防资源抢占。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Per-tenant 密钥隔离与审计日志 schema","id":"per-tenant-密钥隔离与审计日志-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"per-persona secret store","id":"per-persona-secret-store"},{"level":2,"text":"horizontal access 拒绝路径","id":"horizontal-access-拒绝路径"},{"level":2,"text":"audit log schema","id":"audit-log-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"合规接入：SOC2 / GDPR / HIPAA","id":"合规接入-soc2-gdpr-hipaa"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Tier 1 工具栈对照","id":"与-tier-1-工具栈对照"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DM pairing 与 persona 隔离工作空间","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/dm-pairing-and-isolation"},"next":{"title":"并发多租户编排与资源调度","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/concurrent-tenant-orchestration"}}